# ── DEVELOPMENT-ONLY — never ships to the public repo ────────────────────────
# These are absent here because nobody ever added them, not because anything
# stopped them. A `git add -A` during a release would sweep in the breaker
# suite, the internal changelog and the brain files — which between them name
# every fleet agent, the second box, and absolute paths on the dev machine.
# Added 2026-08-03, before the 4.9.10 push, precisely because the guard should
# exist BEFORE someone reaches for a shortcut under release pressure.

